                                "sense_id": "33bc2aee-a422-3260-adb5-a439c2b6ade4",
                                "text": "If the adversaries of a nullo revoke, the declarer can give them three of his tricks, or take 100 in honours as penalty. If he revokes, they take 100 penalty as usual. SUGGESTIONS FOR BIDDING. The dealer should never bid a nullo originally ..."
